  "id": "beef-bourguignon",
  "name": "Beef Bourguignon",
  "subtitle": "Slow-cooked beef in red wine with bacon and mushrooms",
  "description": "A rich French beef stew braised with red wine, carrots, onions, herbs, bacon, and mushrooms.",
